        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: British Airways, BA CityFlyer, Sun Air, Comair\n- Places: OR Tambo International Airport, Johannesburg, Cape Town International Airport, King Shaka International Airport\n- Topics: British Airways franchise operations, airline bases and focus cities\n\nFacts:\n- British Airways franchise carriers Sun Air and Comair operate aircraft in full British Airways livery, offer full British Airways service, and have staff who wear British Airways uniforms.\n- BA CityFlyer is a wholly owned subsidiary of British Airways.\n- Comair's main base is OR Tambo International Airport in Johannesburg.\n- Comair has focus cities at Cape Town International Airport and King Shaka International Airport.",
